<title>UK: BOE buys 50 mln stg bills/FRG at 5-31/32 percent.</title>
<headline>BOE buys 50 mln stg bills/FRG at 5-31/32 percent.</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1996-11-01</dateline>
<text>
<p>The Bank of England said that it bought bills/FRG totalling 50 million stg for resale to the market in equal amounts on November 15 and 18 at 5-31/32 percent.  </p>
<p>			    EARLY	1200 GMT   1400 GMT   LATE</p>
<p> FORECAST SHORTAGE    1.2 BLN    =	    =	    =</p>
<p> CUMULATIVE SUPPLY     50 MLN    =	    =	    =</p>
<p>DETAILS</p>
<p> BILLS/FRG NOV 15/18   50 MLN#   =	    =	    =</p>
<p># INTEREST RATE - 5-31/32 PCT</p>
</text>
